# Play test of Lanternfall (CIPlay lanternfall, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the pier x -0.5..1,
# z 3..15 (deck 0.8 m); the shore walk round the bay's south side and up the east shore; the stall square x -17..-8,
# z 3..9 (1 m); the hill path up the east horn's crest from its tip (34 27.5) to the stage's pad at 3 -17 (16 m)
# Quest (11 steps): the pier, the programme, the taper, the sunk goods, the fish stall, six lanterns, two hens, twelve
# lanterns, the stage, the finale, the prize.
island Lanternfall
expect step 0
expect title Twelve Lanterns
expect animals Chicken 3
expect animals Dolphin 2
expect animals Turtle 1
expect hidden glow1
expect hidden fireworks
wait 5

# The pier: the programme, the lamplighter's taper, the sunk goods off its end
walk 0.25 12 to 0.25 5 h=0.8
zone pier
expect step 1
read Festival programme
expect step 2
use lantern4
expect message lamplighter's taper
open Lamplighter's box
expect story taper 1
expect step 3
open Sunk festival goods
expect step 4

# The fish stall, the six along the shore walk by the stall square, two loose hens
walk 3 1.6 to -6 2.4 to -6.5 6.4 to -8.6 6.4 h=1
open Fruit stall box
open Fish stall box
expect step 5
use lantern1
use lantern2
use lantern3
use lantern4
use lantern5
use lantern6
expect shown glow6
expect story lit 6
expect step 6
use lantern6
expect message already burning
expect story lit 6
catch Chicken 2
expect step 7

# Up the east shore and the hill path; its six
walk 12 3.5 to 18 12 to 26 19 to 34 27.5 h=0.6
walk 34 27.5 to 44 25.5 to 40 17 to 37 9 to 34 2 to 30 -4 to 24 -9 to 16 -13 to 9 -15 h=16
use lantern7
use lantern8
use lantern9
use lantern10
use lantern11
use lantern12
expect story lit 12
expect step 8
walk 9 -15 to 5 -14.5 h=16
zone stage
expect step 9

# The finale; the prize
use rocketrack
wait 5
expect shown fireworks
expect shown festlights
expect story fan 1
expect step 10
open The festival prize
expect done
